'' RUN: COMMAND, ENVIRON/SETENVIRON, SHELL, EXEC, RUN, CHAIN, DYLIBLOAD and OPEN PIPE with text
'' outside the ANSI code page, given as a string, a ustring and a wstring -- each checked by its
'' effect: a file std/fs sees on disk, a child's own COMMAND and raw GetCommandLineW, the
'' environment block as GetEnvironmentVariableW reads it, a DLL loaded from a folder named in
'' it. A deliberate divergence from fbc, whose runtime hands Windows the bytes as ANSI. Needs
'' the runtime of this commit, so it passes only once the toolchain is repackaged (it links the
'' packaged libfb.a): against the previous one, 12 checks fail.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/unicode-text.tiko -o tests/codegen/unicodetext.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/unicodetext.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/unicodetext.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
